,"name":"Dependency Parsing: Who Did What to Whom","stamp":"DEPENDENCY PARSING: WHO DID WHAT TO WHOM","topic":""},{"id":"u3-03","number":13,"name":"Transition-Based Parsing: Building Trees Step by Step","stamp":"TRANSITION-BASED PARSING: BUILDING TREES STEP BY STEP","topic":""},{"id":"u4-01","number":14,"name":"Word Vectors: Giving Words a Place on a Map","stamp":"WORD VECTORS: GIVING WORDS A PLACE ON A MAP","topic":""},{"id":"u4-02","number":15,"name":"Word2Vec: Learning Word Vectors from Context","stamp":"WORD2VEC: LEARNING WORD VECTORS FROM CONTEXT","topic":""},{"id":"u4-03","number":16,"name":"Recurrent Neural Networks: Reading with Memory","stamp":"RECURRENT NEURAL NETWORKS: READING WITH MEMORY","topic":""},{"id":"u4-04","number":17,"name":"LSTMs: Remembering What Matters","stamp":"LSTMS: REMEMBERING WHAT MATTERS","topic":""},{"id":"u5-01","number":18,"name":"Contextual Embeddings and ELMo","stamp":"CONTEXTUAL EMBEDDINGS AND ELMO","topic":""},{"id":"u5-02","number":19,"name":"BERT: Reading in Both Directions","stamp":"BERT: READING IN BOTH DIRECTIONS","topic":""}]},"stop":{"number":3,"name":"Text Classification: Teaching Computers to Sort Text","stamp":"TEXT CLASSIFICATION: TEACHING COMPUTERS TO SORT TEXT"},"shorts":{"width":1080,"height":1920,"maxSeconds":60,"cta":"Full lesson: NLP, Simply Explained · Unit 1"},"thumbnail":{"headline":"How a spam filter decides","big":"spam or not?"},"segments":[{"id":"intro","kind":"intro","component":"TitleCard","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c01","start":0.6,"end":7.012,"marks":{},"text":"Welcome back to NLP, Simply Explained. This is unit 1, lesson 3: text classification.","words":[{"w":"Welcome","start":0.6},{"w":"back","start":1.08},{"w":"to","start":1.427},{"w":"NLP,","start":1.773},{"w":"Simply","start":2.12},{"w":"Explained.","start":2.76},{"w":"This","start":3.52},{"w":"is","start":3.8},{"w":"unit","start":4.04},{"w":"1,","start":4.413},{"w":"lesson","start":4.787},{"w":"3:","start":5.16},{"w":"text","start":5.56},{"w":"classification.","start":6}]},{"id":"c02","start":7.412,"end":16.008,"marks":{},"text":"Last time we cut text into tokens. Today we use those pieces to answer a simple question about a whole message: which kind is it?","words":[{"w":"Last","start":7.412},{"w":"time","start":7.772},{"w":"we","start":8.052},{"w":"cut","start":8.212},{"w":"text","start":8.452},{"w":"into","start":8.932},{"w":"tokens.","start":9.172},{"w":"Today","start":9.872},{"w":"we","start":10.572},{"w":"use","start":10.772},{"w":"those","start":11.092},{"w":"pieces","start":11.372},{"w":"to","start":11.772},{"w":"answer","start":11.972},{"w":"a","start":12.252},{"w":"simple","start":12.625},{"w":"question","start":12.999},{"w":"about","start":13.372},{"w":"a","start":13.612},{"w":"whole","start":13.772},{"w":"message:","start":14.052},{"w":"which","start":14.772},{"w":"kind","start":15.172},{"w":"is","start":15.492},{"w":"it?","start":15.732}]}],"title":"Welcome","shortTitle":"Welcome","props":{"kicker":"Unit 1 · Lesson 3","title":"Text Classification","subtitle":"Teaching computers to sort text"},"start":0.6,"end":16.008,"startFrame":0,"durationInFrames":508},{"id":"idea","kind":"core","component":"BigIdea","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c03","start":16.933,"end":23.034,"marks":{},"text":"Here is the idea in one line. Classification means putting each piece of text into the right box.","words":[{"w":"Here","start":16.933},{"w":"is","start":17.253},{"w":"the","start":17.413},{"w":"idea","start":17.613},{"w":"in","start":18.133},{"w":"one","start":18.373},{"w":"line.","start":18.613},{"w":"Classification","start":19.093},{"w":"means","start":20.213},{"w":"putting","start":20.533},{"w":"each","start":20.893},{"w":"piece","start":21.173},{"w":"of","start":21.413},{"w":"text","start":21.533},{"w":"into","start":21.933},{"w":"the","start":22.133},{"w":"right","start":22.253},{"w":"box.","start":22.533}]}],"title":"The big idea","shortTitle":"The big idea","props":{"kicker":"Key idea","text":"Classification means putting each piece of text into the right box.","highlight":["right box"]},"start":16.933,"end":23.034,"startFrame":508,"durationInFrames":211},{"id":"everyday","kind":"core","component":"Bullets","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c04","start":23.967,"end":28.545,"marks":{},"text":"You use text classifiers every day, often without noticing. Here are four.","words":[{"w":"You","start":23.967},{"w":"use","start":24.127},{"w":"text","start":24.327},{"w":"classifiers","start":24.687},{"w":"every","start":25.487},{"w":"day,","start":25.767},{"w":"often","start":26.087},{"w":"without","start":26.527},{"w":"noticing.","start":26.807},{"w":"Here","start":27.567},{"w":"are","start":27.927},{"w":"four.","start":28.127}]},{"id":"c05","start":28.945,"end":32.761,"marks":{},"text":"Your email decides whether each message is spam or not spam.","words":[{"w":"Your","start":28.945},{"w":"email","start":29.265},{"w":"decides","start":29.585},{"w":"whether","start":30.065},{"w":"each","start":30.305},{"w":"message","start":30.545},{"w":"is","start":30.985},{"w":"spam","start":31.365},{"w":"or","start":31.745},{"w":"not","start":31.985},{"w":"spam.","start":32.265}]},{"id":"c06","start":33.161,"end":36.61,"marks":{},"text":"Shopping sites sort reviews into positive and negative.","words":[{"w":"Shopping","start":33.161},{"w":"sites","start":33.641},{"w":"sort","start":34.121},{"w":"reviews","start":34.441},{"w":"into","start":34.961},{"w":"positive","start":35.201},{"w":"and","start":35.801},{"w":"negative.","start":35.961}]},{"id":"c07","start":37.01,"end":40.719,"marks":{},"text":"Help desks route each support ticket to the team that should answer it.","words":[{"w":"Help","start":37.01},{"w":"desks","start":37.33},{"w":"route","start":37.81},{"w":"each","start":38.21},{"w":"support","start":38.45},{"w":"ticket","start":38.81},{"w":"to","start":39.21},{"w":"the","start":39.33},{"w":"team","start":39.49},{"w":"that","start":39.77},{"w":"should","start":39.93},{"w":"answer","start":40.13},{"w":"it.","start":40.49}]},{"id":"c08","start":41.119,"end":46.035,"marks":{},"text":"And your phone guesses which language a message is written in, so it can offer to translate it.","words":[{"w":"And","start":41.119},{"w":"your","start":41.199},{"w":"phone","start":41.399},{"w":"guesses","start":41.759},{"w":"which","start":42.239},{"w":"language","start":42.479},{"w":"a","start":42.959},{"w":"message","start":43.079},{"w":"is","start":43.479},{"w":"written","start":43.679},{"w":"in,","start":44.039},{"w":"so","start":44.319},{"w":"it","start":44.559},{"w":"can","start":44.679},{"w":"offer","start":44.839},{"w":"to","start":45.159},{"w":"translate","start":45.319},{"w":"it.","start":45.879}]}],"title":"Where you meet it","shortTitle":"Where you meet it","props":{"kicker":"Every day","title":"You use text classifiers all the time","items":[{"text":"Spam or not spam"},{"text":"Positive or negative review"},{"text":"Which team should answer a support ticket"},{"text":"Which language a message is written in"}],"numbered":false},"start":23.967,"end":46.035,"startFrame":719,"durationInFrames":690},{"id":"classifier","kind":"core","component":"Definition","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c09","start":46.967,"end":53.831,"marks":{},"text":"The program doing the sorting is called a classifier. It reads a piece of text and picks one label from a fixed list.","words":[{"w":"The","start":46.967},{"w":"program","start":47.26},{"w":"doing","start":47.554},{"w":"the","start":47.847},{"w":"sorting","start":48.007},{"w":"is","start":48.447},{"w":"called","start":48.647},{"w":"a","start":48.927},{"w":"classifier.","start":49.047},{"w":"It","start":50.007},{"w":"reads","start":50.247},{"w":"a","start":50.607},{"w":"piece","start":50.767},{"w":"of","start":51.007},{"w":"text","start":51.167},{"w":"and","start":51.607},{"w":"picks","start":51.807},{"w":"one","start":52.167},{"w":"label","start":52.407},{"w":"from","start":52.807},{"w":"a","start":52.927},{"w":"fixed","start":53.047},{"w":"list.","start":53.447}]},{"id":"c10","start":54.231,"end":58.863,"marks":{},"text":"For example, it reads \"WIN a FREE prize!!!\" and picks the label \"spam\".","words":[{"w":"For","start":54.231},{"w":"example,","start":54.391},{"w":"it","start":54.951},{"w":"reads","start":55.111},{"w":"\"WIN","start":55.524},{"w":"a","start":55.938},{"w":"FREE","start":56.351},{"w":"prize!!!\"","start":56.631},{"w":"and","start":57.111},{"w":"picks","start":57.431},{"w":"the","start":57.751},{"w":"label","start":57.911},{"w":"\"spam\".","start":58.351}]},{"id":"c11","start":59.263,"end":65.392,"marks":{},"text":"Think of a post-office sorter: every letter goes into exactly one pigeonhole, based on what's written on it.","words":[{"w":"Think","start":59.263},{"w":"of","start":59.463},{"w":"a","start":59.583},{"w":"post-office","start":60.09},{"w":"sorter:","start":60.596},{"w":"every","start":61.103},{"w":"letter","start":61.423},{"w":"goes","start":61.823},{"w":"into","start":62.103},{"w":"exactly","start":62.343},{"w":"one","start":62.903},{"w":"pigeonhole,","start":63.423},{"w":"based","start":63.943},{"w":"on","start":64.303},{"w":"what's","start":64.463},{"w":"written","start":64.743},{"w":"on","start":65.063},{"w":"it.","start":65.223}]}],"title":"What is a classifier?","shortTitle":"What is a classifier?","props":{"kicker":"Definition","term":"Classifier","definition":"A program that reads a piece of text and picks one label from a fixed list.","example":"“WIN a FREE prize!!!” → spam","analogy":"A post-office sorter dropping each letter into the right pigeonhole."},"start":46.967,"end":65.392,"startFrame":1409,"durationInFrames":580},{"id":"learn","kind":"core","component":"Steps","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c12","start":66.3,"end":72.287,"marks":{},"text":"Nobody writes the sorting rules by hand. A classifier learns them from examples, in four steps.","words":[{"w":"Nobody","start":66.3},{"w":"writes","start":66.78},{"w":"the","start":67.1},{"w":"sorting","start":67.26},{"w":"rules","start":67.62},{"w":"by","start":68.06},{"w":"hand.","start":68.3},{"w":"A","start":68.74},{"w":"classifier","start":68.94},{"w":"learns","start":69.82},{"w":"them","start":70.18},{"w":"from","start":70.38},{"w":"examples,","start":70.54},{"w":"in","start":71.22},{"w":"four","start":71.42},{"w":"steps.","start":71.7}]},{"id":"c13","start":72.687,"end":79.717,"marks":{},"text":"Collect: gather lots of texts that already have the right label, like emails people have marked as spam or not spam.","words":[{"w":"Collect:","start":72.687},{"w":"gather","start":73.327},{"w":"lots","start":73.727},{"w":"of","start":74.047},{"w":"texts","start":74.207},{"w":"that","start":74.647},{"w":"already","start":74.807},{"w":"have","start":75.207},{"w":"the","start":75.367},{"w":"right","start":75.487},{"w":"label,","start":75.767},{"w":"like","start":76.367},{"w":"emails","start":76.647},{"w":"people","start":77.247},{"w":"have","start":77.527},{"w":"marked","start":77.727},{"w":"as","start":78.047},{"w":"spam","start":78.367},{"w":"or","start":78.687},{"w":"not","start":78.927},{"w":"spam.","start":79.207}]},{"id":"c14","start":80.117,"end":86.663,"marks":{},"text":"Find clues: turn each text into clues the computer can count. The simplest clues are the words themselves.","words":[{"w":"Find","start":80.297},{"w":"clues:","start":80.477},{"w":"turn","start":81.077},{"w":"each","start":81.397},{"w":"text","start":81.717},{"w":"into","start":82.117},{"w":"clues","start":82.357},{"w":"the","start":82.677},{"w":"computer","start":82.837},{"w":"can","start":83.357},{"w":"count.","start":83.597},{"w":"The","start":84.037},{"w":"simplest","start":84.277},{"w":"clues","start":84.917},{"w":"are","start":85.317},{"w":"the","start":85.397},{"w":"words","start":85.597},{"w":"themselves.","start":85.997}]},{"id":"c15","start":87.063,"end":90.831,"marks":{},"text":"Train: let the computer learn which clues usually point to which label.","words":[{"w":"Train:","start":87.063},{"w":"let","start":87.543},{"w":"the","start":87.743},{"w":"computer","start":87.943},{"w":"learn","start":88.423},{"w":"which","start":88.703},{"w":"clues","start":88.903},{"w":"usually","start":89.343},{"w":"point","start":89.783},{"w":"to","start":90.023},{"w":"which","start":90.183},{"w":"label.","start":90.383}]},{"id":"c16","start":91.231,"end":94.941,"marks":{},"text":"Predict: give it a new text it has never seen, and it picks a label.","words":[{"w":"Predict:","start":91.231},{"w":"give","start":91.791},{"w":"it","start":91.951},{"w":"a","start":92.071},{"w":"new","start":92.191},{"w":"text","start":92.351},{"w":"it","start":92.751},{"w":"has","start":92.871},{"w":"never","start":93.071},{"w":"seen,","start":93.351},{"w":"and","start":93.711},{"w":"it","start":93.911},{"w":"picks","start":94.071},{"w":"a","start":94.391},{"w":"label.","start":94.511}]}],"title":"How a classifier learns","shortTitle":"How a classifier learns","props":{"kicker":"Learning from examples","title":"How a classifier learns","steps":[{"label":"Collect","detail":"examples with the right label"},{"label":"Find clues","detail":"words that hint at a label"},{"label":"Train","detail":"learn which clues point where"},{"label":"Predict","detail":"label text it has never seen"}]},"start":66.3,"end":94.941,"startFrame":1989,"durationInFrames":887},{"id":"clues","kind":"core","component":"Table","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c17","start":95.867,"end":104.175,"marks":{},"text":"Here is a small made-up example. Out of a hundred training emails, this table shows how many spam and normal emails contain each word.","words":[{"w":"Here","start":95.867},{"w":"is","start":96.147},{"w":"a","start":96.347},{"w":"small","start":96.467},{"w":"made-up","start":96.867},{"w":"example.","start":97.267},{"w":"Out","start":97.667},{"w":"of","start":98.067},{"w":"a","start":98.267},{"w":"hundred","start":98.427},{"w":"training","start":98.747},{"w":"emails,","start":99.327},{"w":"this","start":99.907},{"w":"table","start":100.187},{"w":"shows","start":100.587},{"w":"how","start":100.947},{"w":"many","start":101.147},{"w":"spam","start":101.467},{"w":"and","start":101.827},{"w":"normal","start":102.027},{"w":"emails","start":102.527},{"w":"contain","start":103.027},{"w":"each","start":103.547},{"w":"word.","start":103.827}]},{"id":"c18","start":104.575,"end":110.043,"marks":{},"text":"\"free\" appears in thirty spam emails, but only two normal ones. A strong hint of spam.","words":[{"w":"\"free\"","start":104.575},{"w":"appears","start":104.895},{"w":"in","start":105.295},{"w":"thirty","start":105.455},{"w":"spam","start":105.815},{"w":"emails,","start":106.275},{"w":"but","start":106.735},{"w":"only","start":106.975},{"w":"two","start":107.215},{"w":"normal","start":107.455},{"w":"ones.","start":107.975},{"w":"A","start":108.455},{"w":"strong","start":108.655},{"w":"hint","start":109.055},{"w":"of","start":109.415},{"w":"spam.","start":109.575}]},{"id":"c19","start":110.443,"end":114.493,"marks":{},"text":"\"winner\" is similar: eighteen spam emails, just one normal one.","words":[{"w":"\"winner\"","start":110.443},{"w":"is","start":110.883},{"w":"similar:","start":111.083},{"w":"eighteen","start":111.643},{"w":"spam","start":112.283},{"w":"emails,","start":112.763},{"w":"just","start":113.243},{"w":"one","start":113.483},{"w":"normal","start":113.723},{"w":"one.","start":114.243}]},{"id":"c20","start":114.893,"end":120.978,"marks":{},"text":"\"meeting\" goes the other way: it appears in twenty-five normal emails and only one spam email.","words":[{"w":"\"meeting\"","start":114.893},{"w":"goes","start":115.413},{"w":"the","start":115.733},{"w":"other","start":115.893},{"w":"way:","start":116.133},{"w":"it","start":116.493},{"w":"appears","start":116.773},{"w":"in","start":117.173},{"w":"twenty-five","start":117.633},{"w":"normal","start":118.093},{"w":"emails","start":118.653},{"w":"and","start":119.213},{"w":"only","start":119.453},{"w":"one","start":119.733},{"w":"spam","start":120.053},{"w":"email.","start":120.516}]},{"id":"c21","start":121.378,"end":126.85,"marks":{},"text":"And \"invoice\" leans towards normal mail too, but more weakly: twelve normal, three spam.","words":[{"w":"And","start":121.378},{"w":"\"invoice\"","start":121.538},{"w":"leans","start":122.098},{"w":"towards","start":122.498},{"w":"normal","start":122.898},{"w":"mail","start":123.231},{"w":"too,","start":123.565},{"w":"but","start":123.898},{"w":"more","start":124.098},{"w":"weakly:","start":124.338},{"w":"twelve","start":125.018},{"w":"normal,","start":125.458},{"w":"three","start":126.058},{"w":"spam.","start":126.454}]}],"title":"Words as clues","shortTitle":"Words as clues","props":{"kicker":"Example training set","title":"Emails containing each word (out of 100)","columns":["Word","In spam","In normal mail"],"rows":[["free","30","2"],["winner","18","1"],["meeting","1","25"],["invoice","3","12"]],"highlight":[{"row":0,"col":1},{"row":2,"col":2}]},"start":95.867,"end":126.85,"startFrame":2876,"durationInFrames":957},{"id":"bayes","kind":"core","component":"Bullets","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c22","start":127.767,"end":134.322,"marks":{},"text":"One of the oldest and simplest classifiers is called Naive Bayes. The idea is to let the clues vote.","words":[{"w":"One","start":127.767},{"w":"of","start":127.927},{"w":"the","start":128.047},{"w":"oldest","start":128.247},{"w":"and","start":128.687},{"w":"simplest","start":128.847},{"w":"classifiers","start":129.407},{"w":"is","start":130.247},{"w":"called","start":130.487},{"w":"Naive","start":130.847},{"w":"Bayes.","start":131.447},{"w":"The","start":132.047},{"w":"idea","start":132.367},{"w":"is","start":132.887},{"w":"to","start":133.087},{"w":"let","start":133.247},{"w":"the","start":133.447},{"w":"clues","start":133.739},{"w":"vote.","start":134.03}]},{"id":"c23","start":134.722,"end":136.716,"marks":{},"text":"Every word in the email is a clue.","words":[{"w":"Every","start":134.722},{"w":"word","start":135.002},{"w":"in","start":135.242},{"w":"the","start":135.362},{"w":"email","start":135.682},{"w":"is","start":136.002},{"w":"a","start":136.162},{"w":"clue.","start":136.282}]},{"id":"c24","start":137.116,"end":140.39,"marks":{},"text":"Words that are common in spam add weight to the spam side.","words":[{"w":"Words","start":137.116},{"w":"that","start":137.436},{"w":"are","start":137.596},{"w":"common","start":137.756},{"w":"in","start":138.076},{"w":"spam","start":138.276},{"w":"add","start":138.716},{"w":"weight","start":139.116},{"w":"to","start":139.396},{"w":"the","start":139.476},{"w":"spam","start":139.781},{"w":"side.","start":140.085}]},{"id":"c25","start":140.79,"end":144.554,"marks":{},"text":"Words that are common in normal mail add weight to the normal side.","words":[{"w":"Words","start":140.79},{"w":"that","start":141.15},{"w":"are","start":141.31},{"w":"common","start":141.51},{"w":"in","start":141.83},{"w":"normal","start":142.03},{"w":"mail","start":142.41},{"w":"add","start":142.79},{"w":"weight","start":143.15},{"w":"to","start":143.43},{"w":"the","start":143.55},{"w":"normal","start":143.885},{"w":"side.","start":144.219}]},{"id":"c26","start":144.954,"end":156.057,"marks":{},"text":"Whichever side ends up heavier wins. And it's called \"naive\" because it judges each word on its own, ignoring word order, which is a simplification that works surprisingly well.","words":[{"w":"Whichever","start":145.287},{"w":"side","start":145.621},{"w":"ends","start":145.954},{"w":"up","start":146.274},{"w":"heavier","start":146.474},{"w":"wins.","start":146.994},{"w":"And","start":147.514},{"w":"it's","start":147.754},{"w":"called","start":148.034},{"w":"\"naive\"","start":148.434},{"w":"because","start":149.114},{"w":"it","start":149.354},{"w":"judges","start":149.594},{"w":"each","start":150.154},{"w":"word","start":150.394},{"w":"on","start":150.674},{"w":"its","start":150.874},{"w":"own,","start":151.327},{"w":"ignoring","start":151.781},{"w":"word","start":152.234},{"w":"order,","start":152.554},{"w":"which","start":153.034},{"w":"is","start":153.234},{"w":"a","start":153.394},{"w":"simplification","start":153.514},{"w":"that","start":154.354},{"w":"works","start":154.554},{"w":"surprisingly","start":154.914},{"w":"well.","start":155.754}]}],"title":"Naive Bayes in plain words","shortTitle":"Naive Bayes in plain words","props":{"kicker":"Naive Bayes","title":"Let the clues vote","items":[{"text":"Every word in the email is a clue"},{"text":"Spam-like words add weight to spam"},{"text":"Normal-mail words add weight to normal"},{"text":"The heavier side wins"},{"text":"“Naive”: each word is judged on its own"}],"numbered":true},"start":127.767,"end":156.057,"startFrame":3833,"durationInFrames":876},{"id":"eval","kind":"core","component":"Compare","short":true,"cues":[{"id":"c27","start":156.967,"end":163.136,"marks":{},"text":"So how do we know if a spam filter is any good? There are two questions to ask, and they're easy to mix up.","words":[{"w":"So","start":156.967},{"w":"how","start":157.127},{"w":"do","start":157.287},{"w":"we","start":157.447},{"w":"know","start":157.647},{"w":"if","start":157.847},{"w":"a","start":158.007},{"w":"spam","start":158.34},{"w":"filter","start":158.674},{"w":"is","start":159.007},{"w":"any","start":159.167},{"w":"good?","start":159.447},{"w":"There","start":159.807},{"w":"are","start":160.047},{"w":"two","start":160.38},{"w":"questions","start":160.714},{"w":"to","start":161.047},{"w":"ask,","start":161.247},{"w":"and","start":161.607},{"w":"they're","start":161.807},{"w":"easy","start":162.087},{"w":"to","start":162.407},{"w":"mix","start":162.607},{"w":"up.","start":162.887}]},{"id":"c28","start":163.536,"end":172.321,"marks":{},"text":"The first is precision: of all the mail the filter marked as spam, how much really was spam? Low precision means real emails go missing.","words":[{"w":"The","start":163.536},{"w":"first","start":163.696},{"w":"is","start":164.016},{"w":"precision:","start":164.256},{"w":"of","start":164.976},{"w":"all","start":165.216},{"w":"the","start":165.376},{"w":"mail","start":165.596},{"w":"the","start":165.816},{"w":"filter","start":166.016},{"w":"marked","start":166.456},{"w":"as","start":166.776},{"w":"spam,","start":167.156},{"w":"how","start":167.536},{"w":"much","start":167.856},{"w":"really","start":168.096},{"w":"was","start":168.416},{"w":"spam?","start":168.736},{"w":"Low","start":169.456},{"w":"precision","start":169.816},{"w":"means","start":170.416},{"w":"real","start":170.736},{"w":"emails","start":171.196},{"w":"go","start":171.656},{"w":"missing.","start":171.816}]},{"id":"c29","start":172.721,"end":182.065,"marks":{"verdict":180.321},"text":"The second is recall: of all the spam that arrived, how much did the filter catch? Low recall means spam fills your inbox. A good filter needs both.","words":[{"w":"The","start":172.721},{"w":"second","start":172.881},{"w":"is","start":173.281},{"w":"recall:","start":173.441},{"w":"of","start":174.041},{"w":"all","start":174.281},{"w":"the","start":174.441},{"w":"spam","start":174.701},{"w":"that","start":174.961},{"w":"arrived,","start":175.161},{"w":"how","start":175.681},{"w":"much","start":175.921},{"w":"did","start":176.161},{"w":"the","start":176.361},{"w":"filter","start":176.481},{"w":"catch?","start":176.961},{"w":"Low","start":177.521},{"w":"recall","start":177.841},{"w":"means","start":178.361},{"w":"spam","start":178.721},{"w":"fills","start":179.081},{"w":"your","start":179.401},{"w":"inbox.","start":179.861},{"w":"A","start":180.321},{"w":"good","start":180.561},{"w":"filter","start":180.801},{"w":"needs","start":181.281},{"w":"both.","start":181.681}]}],"title":"Precision and recall","shortTitle":"Precision vs recall, explained with your spam folder","props":{"kicker":"Is it any good?","title":"Two ways to grade a spam filter","columns":[{"title":"Precision","items":["Of the mail marked spam,","how much really was spam?","Low: real emails go missing"],"tone":"neutral"},{"title":"Recall","items":["Of all the real spam,","how much did we catch?","Low: spam fills your inbox"],"tone":"neutral"}],"verdict":{"text":"A good filter needs both","at":"c29@verdict"}},"start":156.967,"end":182.065,"startFrame":4709,"durationInFrames":780},{"id":"test","kind":"core","component":"BarChart","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c30","start":182.967,"end":185.62,"marks":{},"text":"Let's check our filter on a hundred test emails.","words":[{"w":"Let's","start":182.967},{"w":"check","start":183.247},{"w":"our","start":183.527},{"w":"filter","start":183.687},{"w":"on","start":184.087},{"w":"a","start":184.247},{"w":"hundred","start":184.367},{"w":"test","start":184.647},{"w":"emails.","start":185.134}]},{"id":"c31","start":186.02,"end":187.713,"marks":{},"text":"It marked twenty of them as spam.","words":[{"w":"It","start":186.02},{"w":"marked","start":186.14},{"w":"twenty","start":186.42},{"w":"of","start":186.7},{"w":"them","start":186.82},{"w":"as","start":187.02},{"w":"spam.","start":187.367}]},{"id":"c32","start":188.113,"end":193.904,"marks":{},"text":"Eighteen of those twenty really were spam, so its precision is eighteen out of twenty: ninety percent.","words":[{"w":"Eighteen","start":188.113},{"w":"of","start":188.513},{"w":"those","start":188.593},{"w":"twenty","start":188.833},{"w":"really","start":189.153},{"w":"were","start":189.513},{"w":"spam,","start":189.833},{"w":"so","start":190.153},{"w":"its","start":190.353},{"w":"precision","start":190.633},{"w":"is","start":191.153},{"w":"eighteen","start":191.313},{"w":"out","start":191.653},{"w":"of","start":191.993},{"w":"twenty:","start":192.153},{"w":"ninety","start":192.753},{"w":"percent.","start":193.329}]},{"id":"c33","start":194.304,"end":203.455,"marks":{},"text":"But the test set held twenty-four spam emails in total, and it caught eighteen. So its recall is eighteen out of twenty-four: seventy-five percent.","words":[{"w":"But","start":194.304},{"w":"the","start":194.384},{"w":"test","start":194.584},{"w":"set","start":194.864},{"w":"held","start":195.104},{"w":"twenty-four","start":195.564},{"w":"spam","start":196.024},{"w":"emails","start":196.464},{"w":"in","start":196.904},{"w":"total,","start":197.104},{"w":"and","start":197.584},{"w":"it","start":197.784},{"w":"caught","start":197.984},{"w":"eighteen.","start":198.304},{"w":"So","start":199.024},{"w":"its","start":199.304},{"w":"recall","start":199.584},{"w":"is","start":200.104},{"w":"eighteen","start":200.304},{"w":"out","start":200.824},{"w":"of","start":200.944},{"w":"twenty-four:","start":201.572},{"w":"seventy-five","start":202.2},{"w":"percent.","start":202.827}]}],"title":"Checking the filter","shortTitle":"Checking the filter","props":{"kicker":"Example test","title":"Our filter on 100 test emails","unit":"emails","bars":[{"label":"Marked as spam","value":20},{"label":"…really spam","value":18},{"label":"All real spam","value":24}],"note":"Precision: 18 of 20 (90%) · Recall: 18 of 24 (75%)"},"start":182.967,"end":203.455,"startFrame":5489,"durationInFrames":642},{"id":"quiz","kind":"quiz","component":"Quiz","short":true,"cues":[{"id":"c34","start":204.367,"end":212.333,"marks":{},"text":"Time for a quick quiz. An important email from your boss lands in the spam folder. Which number went down: precision, or recall?","words":[{"w":"Time","start":204.367},{"w":"for","start":204.687},{"w":"a","start":204.977},{"w":"quick","start":205.267},{"w":"quiz.","start":205.557},{"w":"An","start":205.847},{"w":"important","start":206.087},{"w":"email","start":206.587},{"w":"from","start":207.087},{"w":"your","start":207.247},{"w":"boss","start":207.407},{"w":"lands","start":207.727},{"w":"in","start":207.967},{"w":"the","start":208.207},{"w":"spam","start":208.447},{"w":"folder.","start":208.687},{"w":"Which","start":209.127},{"w":"number","start":209.567},{"w":"went","start":210.007},{"w":"down:","start":210.327},{"w":"precision,","start":210.727},{"w":"or","start":211.487},{"w":"recall?","start":211.727}]},{"id":"c35","start":212.733,"end":214.264,"marks":{},"text":"Pause the video and decide.","words":[{"w":"Pause","start":212.733},{"w":"the","start":213.013},{"w":"video","start":213.133},{"w":"and","start":213.533},{"w":"decide.","start":213.693}]},{"id":"c36","start":217.664,"end":224.114,"marks":{},"text":"It's precision. A real email marked as spam is a false alarm, and false alarms lower precision.","words":[{"w":"It's","start":217.664},{"w":"precision.","start":217.944},{"w":"A","start":218.744},{"w":"real","start":218.944},{"w":"email","start":219.384},{"w":"marked","start":219.824},{"w":"as","start":220.144},{"w":"spam","start":220.444},{"w":"is","start":220.744},{"w":"a","start":220.904},{"w":"false","start":221.024},{"w":"alarm,","start":221.384},{"w":"and","start":221.904},{"w":"false","start":222.144},{"w":"alarms","start":222.544},{"w":"lower","start":223.144},{"w":"precision.","start":223.504}]}],"title":"Quick quiz","shortTitle":"Quick quiz: your boss's email went to spam. What failed?","props":{"kicker":"Pause and predict","question":"An important email from your boss lands in the spam folder. Which number went down?","options":["Precision","Recall","Neither"],"answer":0,"explain":"A real email marked as spam is a false alarm, and false alarms lower precision."},"start":204.367,"end":224.114,"startFrame":6131,"durationInFrames":620},{"id":"recap","kind":"recap","component":"Recap","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c37","start":225.033,"end":229.802,"marks":{},"text":"Let's recap. A classifier reads text and picks one label from a fixed list.","words":[{"w":"Let's","start":225.033},{"w":"recap.","start":225.393},{"w":"A","start":226.033},{"w":"classifier","start":226.233},{"w":"reads","start":227.033},{"w":"text","start":227.433},{"w":"and","start":227.833},{"w":"picks","start":227.993},{"w":"one","start":228.313},{"w":"label","start":228.513},{"w":"from","start":228.873},{"w":"a","start":228.993},{"w":"fixed","start":229.113},{"w":"list.","start":229.433}]},{"id":"c38","start":230.202,"end":233.528,"marks":{},"text":"It learns from labelled examples, using words as clues.","words":[{"w":"It","start":230.202},{"w":"learns","start":230.362},{"w":"from","start":230.682},{"w":"labelled","start":230.842},{"w":"examples,","start":231.362},{"w":"using","start":232.082},{"w":"words","start":232.522},{"w":"as","start":232.842},{"w":"clues.","start":233.042}]},{"id":"c39","start":233.928,"end":238.326,"marks":{},"text":"Naive Bayes lets every word vote on its own, and the heavier side wins.","words":[{"w":"Naive","start":233.928},{"w":"Bayes","start":234.368},{"w":"lets","start":234.808},{"w":"every","start":235.128},{"w":"word","start":235.408},{"w":"vote","start":235.688},{"w":"on","start":235.968},{"w":"its","start":236.128},{"w":"own,","start":236.328},{"w":"and","start":236.648},{"w":"the","start":236.808},{"w":"heavier","start":237.141},{"w":"side","start":237.475},{"w":"wins.","start":237.808}]},{"id":"c40","start":238.726,"end":243.114,"marks":{},"text":"Precision asks: were the alarms right? Recall asks: did we miss anything?","words":[{"w":"Precision","start":238.726},{"w":"asks:","start":239.326},{"w":"were","start":239.806},{"w":"the","start":239.926},{"w":"alarms","start":240.086},{"w":"right?","start":240.646},{"w":"Recall","start":241.046},{"w":"asks:","start":241.606},{"w":"did","start":242.086},{"w":"we","start":242.246},{"w":"miss","start":242.406},{"w":"anything?","start":242.686}]},{"id":"c41","start":243.514,"end":248.258,"marks":{},"text":"Next lesson: Language Models. How can a computer guess what word comes next?","words":[{"w":"Next","start":243.834},{"w":"lesson:","start":244.154},{"w":"Language","start":244.474},{"w":"Models.","start":245.074},{"w":"How","start":245.754},{"w":"can","start":245.914},{"w":"a","start":246.114},{"w":"computer","start":246.274},{"w":"guess","start":246.714},{"w":"what","start":246.994},{"w":"word","start":247.234},{"w":"comes","start